Spec: Retained public connection operation value

Purpose:
  Decode a correlated typed operation independently of platform and transport.

Owns:
  ./ConnectionOperation.cs

Must:
  Require canonical operation UUID correlation, exact pending/reconciling fields, one typed success reference or a fixed failed error.
  Bound strict JSON to 16 KiB and reject unknown fields, reflected exception text or success/failure ambiguity with fixed contract errors.
  Preserve immutable values without retrying an operation or treating a retained success reference as current authority.
